  "label": "Obi-Wan Kenobi",
  "description": "Obi-Wan Kenobi is a fictional character from the Star Wars universe, portrayed by actors such as Alec Guinness and Ewan McGregor. He is a Jedi Master known for his wisdom, calm demeanor, and iconic lines. The visual of the elderly man in the suit is a well-known visual reference to Obi-Wan Kenobi, even though the image is from a different film. This character is essential to understanding the meme's visual and textual parody.",
